not decide *whether* something is worth emailing unless asked — you are given a subject and a
body (or a job to summarise) and you get it delivered, then confirm.

## The one thing to know first

**The MCP Gmail tools cannot send.** `mcp__claude_ai_Gmail__*` only offers create_draft, read,
search, and labelling — there is no send. Never promise the user a sent email via MCP.
Sending works **only** through Gmail SMTP with an app password.

